{
  "title": "Patient Management — overview",
  "source": "modules/patient-management/overview",
  "url": "https://help.medipyxis.com/modules/patient-management/overview/",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "pm-ov-01",
      "claim": "Patient Management is your working roster for patients at the current facility — the working list a clinician uses daily, opened from the Patient Management sidebar item.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "label: \"Patient Management\",",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/components/AppShell.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "My Clinical Day",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/PmClinicianDashboard.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "absent",
          "note": "a patient roster would not be headed My Clinical Day"
        }
      ],
      "finding": "The Patient Management sidebar item (AppShell.tsx:674, /pm-clinician-dashboard) opens PmClinicianDashboard, headed \"My Clinical Day\" — \"Manage your schedule, track visits, and monitor outcomes.\" (frontend/src/pages/PmClinicianDashboard.tsx:75-79). It is a day schedule (day selector, daily schedule, map, Needs Scheduling, overdue visits), not a patient roster. The roster is All Patients.",
      "proposed_text": "Patient Management opens My Clinical Day: your schedule for the day, patients who need scheduling, and overdue visits. The full patient list is All Patients.",
      "proposed_checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "My Clinical Day",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/PmClinicianDashboard.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "<NeedsSchedulingAccordion",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/PmClinicianDashboard.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "<OverdueVisitsCard",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/PmClinicianDashboard.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "import PmClinicianDashboard from \"./pages/PmClinicianDashboard.tsx\";",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/user-routes.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pm-ov-02",
      "claim": "A patient appears on All Patients as soon as you click Create Patient or Approve & Create Patient in Referral Intake — not only after the referral reaches Assigned.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "patient_status: \"ACTIVE\", // FLOW6-1",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/services/referralApi.ts"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "      patient_status: \"ACTIVE\",",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/services/idpService.ts"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "import Patients from \"./pages/all-patients/Patients.tsx\";",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/user-routes.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        }
      ],
      "reason": "The page also says the patient appears on Patient Management at once; that screen is a schedule (see pm-ov-01), so only the All Patients half is checked here."
    },
    {
      "id": "pm-ov-03",
      "claim": "All Patients — the full directory, opened from the All Patients sidebar item.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "label: \"All Patients\",",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/components/AppShell.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pm-ov-04",
      "claim": "On All Patients you can filter status to Active, On Hold, Discharged, or Archived. New patients from Referral Intake are created as Active.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "<option value=\"(active|on_hold|discharged)\">(Active|On Hold|Discharged)</option>",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/all-patients/Patients.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": {
            "count": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "{isOnline && <option value=\"archived\">Archived</option>}",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/all-patients/Patients.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present",
          "note": "Archived appears only when online"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "patient_status: \"ACTIVE\", // FLOW6-1",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/services/referralApi.ts"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pm-ov-05",
      "claim": "List columns: Name / DOB (click to open the chart), MRN (assigned when the patient is created), Status (Active · On Hold · Discharged · Archived).",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "ignoreCase": true,
          "pattern": "patient\\.(mrn|dob|date_of_birth)",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/all-patients/Patients.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        }
      ],
      "finding": "All Patients is a grid of cards, not a list with columns. Each card shows name, status pill (upper case, e.g. \"ON HOLD\"), facility, flags, age, wound count, visit count and primary condition; it shows no MRN and no DOB (frontend/src/pages/all-patients/Patients.tsx:1645-1830). The chart opens from the card's View button (:1850-1866), not by clicking the name. MRN is generated at create by the database (referralApi.ts MRN retry block) and shown in the create success message.",
      "proposed_text": "All Patients shows one card per patient with name, status (ACTIVE, ON HOLD, DISCHARGED, or ARCHIVED), age, wounds, and visits. Click View on a card to open the chart. The MRN appears in the success message after Create Patient.",
      "proposed_checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": ".toUpperCase()}",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/all-patients/Patients.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "{patient.wound_count || 0}",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/all-patients/Patients.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "patientChartPath(",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/all-patients/Patients.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "? `Referral created successfully! MRN: ${patientMrn}`",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/ReferralsNewPage.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pm-ov-06",
      "claim": "You cannot delete a patient. Use Archive on the patient to retire a record; archived patients are preserved.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "Delete Patient",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src"
          ],
          "excludeTests": true,
          "expect": "absent"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "title=\"Archive patient\"",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/all-patients/Patients.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "patient_status: \"ARCHIVED\",",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/Referrals.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present",
          "note": "archive is a soft delete (deleted_at + ARCHIVED)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pm-ov-07",
      "claim": "You can restore an archived patient back to Active.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": ".update({ deleted_at: null, updated_at: now, patient_status: \"ACTIVE\" })",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/all-patients/Patients.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "title=\"Unarchive patient\"",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/all-patients/Patients.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "commit": "5d93bb5 (live on main)",
  "provenance": "Extracted from the live page text in the MEDA-379 first pass (medipyxis-help commit 27e4ddb), before any rewrite."
}